{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22506","headline":"长相思 · 白居易","name":"长相思","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九月西风兴，月冷露华凝。\n思君秋夜长，一夜魂九升。\n二月东风来，草拆花心开。\n思君春日迟，一日肠九回。\n妾住洛桥北，君住洛桥南。\n十五即相识，今年二十三。\n有如女萝草，生在松之侧。\n蔓短枝苦高，萦回上不得。\n人言人有愿，愿至天必成。\n愿作远方兽，步步比肩行。\n愿作深山木，枝枝连理生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22506.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22506","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}